         <title>
            SmartIndicator Version 1.4.1
         </title>
         <description>
            <p>
               This update installs the script SmartIndicator Version 1.4.1
               for PixInsight.
            </p>
            <p>
               Under Script-&gt;Render you will find the SmartIndicator. It helps to create and blend an image scale indicator into an image.
            </p>
            <p>
               Last update: added support for small screen-resolutions
            </p>
